 /// Sorts the elements of a list.
 ///
-/// Arguments: None
+/// Arguments:
+/// - None, or a property name (Shopify Liquid's `sort: "property"` form).
 ///
-/// Example: {{ [3, 1, 2] | sort }} => [1, 2, 3]
+/// Examples:
+/// {{ [3, 1, 2] | sort }} => [1, 2, 3]
+/// {{ pages | sort: "priority" }} => pages ordered by their priority value
 dynamic sort(
   dynamic value,
